      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Stucco repair in Calgary starts with what is wrong with the wall</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising service paid by independent Calgary stucco contractors. It does no stucco work, holds no licence, insurance or warranty, and takes no money for work. The contractor who quotes your job contracts with you directly.</p><p>Most enquiries fall into one of a few situations: a wall marked by hail, a flicker hole, cracks around windows, crumbling parging, or a finish that looks tired. Start with <a href="/stucco-repair-calgary/">stucco repair in Calgary</a>, then read about <a href="/hail-woodpecker-stucco-damage/">hail and woodpecker damage</a>, <a href="/parging-calgary/">parging</a> or <a href="/re-stucco-calgary/">re-stucco</a>. The <a href="/stucco-repair-cost-calgary/">stucco repair cost guide</a> lists what Calgary firms publish, firm by firm.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
