<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#F3ECE1;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/stucco-repair-calgary/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 10px;">Stucco Repair & Crack Patching</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Hairline cracks, chips, bulges and gaps around windows and doors, patched to suit the system on your wall. The contractor who sees the wall sets the price, and the cost guide shows what Calgary firms publish.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#A4491F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/parging-calgary/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 10px;">Parging Recoats</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Cosmetic recoating of the parging at the base of a wall when it is cracking or flaking. Foundation crack repair, waterproofing and structural work are not offered through this page.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#A4491F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/hail-woodpecker-stucco-damage/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 10px;">Hail & Woodpecker Damage</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A written repair estimate for hail damage that you can give to your insurer, and patching of northern flicker holes once nesting is over. Your policy and your insurer decide what is covered; this site does not handle claims.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#A4491F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/re-stucco-calgary/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 10px;">Re-Stucco & Recoating</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">For walls that are tired, patchy or damaged across a wide area, a contractor can explain whether a repair, a recoat or a full re-stucco fits. Whole-house prices vary widely by size and system, so the quote follows the site survey.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#A4491F;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
