    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">How an introduction to a Calgary stucco contractor works</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A4491F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 4px;">The contractor quotes you directly</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Sandstone Stucco Co does no stucco work and is not a party to your contract. The independent contractor who visits your house quotes and contracts with you.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A4491F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 4px;">A written estimate you can compare</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Alberta.ca advises insisting on a written contract and getting written estimates from more than one business. The introduction is no-obligation, so you can compare before you decide.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A4491F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 4px;">Clear about what this site is</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">It is an advertising service paid by contractors. It holds no licence, insurance or warranty, so check the contractor yourself: ask about their Calgary business licence (311 can confirm it) and their WCB coverage.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#A4491F" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 4px;">Prices named to their source</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Every price on this site is attributed to the firm that published it, with a note on whether GST is included. Where no reliable Calgary figure exists, the page says the contractor quotes it after seeing the wall.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(42,37,33,0.2);aspect-ratio:4/5;">
        <img src="/images/hero-800.webp" alt="Sandstone Stucco Co at work" width="800" height="800" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
